From: b1air <dimazzzzz342@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 12:50:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Add window_animation: popin, fade, slide or none

swayfx animates windows opening (growing from 80% while fading in) and
closing (the reverse), with no way to choose. window_animation picks the
style, as Hyprland's `animation = windows` does:

  popin [<percent>]  the existing one, from <percent> of the size (80)
  fade               fade in and out in place
  slide              come in from the nearest edge of the workspace, and
                     leave by it
  none               appear and vanish at once; moves still animate
